  "description": "Jacqueline grew up in a forgotten land at the border of three nations, where survival was never guaranteed. In a world that gave her nothing, her younger sibling was her whole world. But everything changed the day her sibling awakened as a rare \"special beastkin.\" Taken away by the state in the name of protection, they were torn from Jacqueline's side. Left with nothing, Jacqueline was forced to take on one more burden from the very person responsible for separating them—Margo, her sibling's guardian. This time, it was a mysterious young bird beastkin named Demi. Years later, fate brings Jacqueline and Demi together once again... but their reunion may change everything.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
